Setting a Station Up
Set a Station Up
You can define how to set up the objects Station, ParallelStation, AssemblyStation, DismantleStation, and
Drain to process another type of MU.
You can:
• Select Set-up Options on the tab Set-Up.
• Select the Set-Up Time on the tab Times.
Compare the sample models: Click the Window ribbon tab, click Start Page > Getting Started > Example
Models > Small Examples. Then, select the respective Category, the Topic, and the Example in the
dialog Examples Collection, and click Open Model.
