Checking the Fill Level of the Buffers
Check the Fill Level of the Buffers in the Plant
At times you may want to show the relative fill level of the Buffer in the plant.
Proceed as follows :
• To display the fill level of the Buffer 
  in 3D, select Fill level from the drop-down list Show Contents
As.
• To view more exact percentages, click the tab Statistics, and check the following values:
◦ Relatively empty shows the portion of the statistics collection period during which the object was
empty in relation to the time during which the object was available.
◦ Relatively full shows the portion of the statistics collection period during which all temporary storage
places of the Buffer were occupied in relation to the time during which the object was available.
Checking the Fill Level of the Buffers
